"<strong>MCP server tip:</strong>\n"
"                        MCP gives agents tools. Treat every server as operational access:\n"
"                        configure the command or URL carefully and expose it only to agents that truly need it."
msgstr ""

#. module: odoo_agent
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odoo_agent.view_agent_runtime_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Runtime tip:</strong>\n"
"                        A runtime is the machine process that polls Odoo, starts executions,\n"
"                        streams logs, and reports completion. Keep API keys scoped and rotate them when a host changes owner."
msgstr ""

#. module: odoo_agent
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odoo_agent.view_agent_skill_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Skill tip:</strong>\n"
"                        A skill should describe one concrete reusable capability, not a whole agent personality.\n"
"                        Keep it short, testable, and specific so the runtime can compose several skills safely."
msgstr ""

